  "body": "Welcome to 6 Moko Road, Orewa, a brand-new, standalone home offering four-bedroom flexibility, effortless single-level living and an impressive elevated outlook.\r\n\r\nDesigned for buyers who want genuine space without the maintenance of a large property, the bright open-plan kitchen, dining and living area creates an inviting heart of the home. Wide stacking doors open the living space to the outdoors, drawing in natural light and connecting everyday life with the expansive outlook beyond.\r\n\r\nThe contemporary kitchen combines sleek cabinetry, generous bench space, quality appliances and excellent storage. Stylish yet highly practical, it provides a welcoming hub for family life and entertaining.\r\n\r\nFour well-proportioned bedrooms are complemented by two modern bathrooms, including a master bedroom with its own ensuite. The additional bedrooms provide excellent flexibility for children, guests or working from home, making the layout equally appealing to families and downsizers wanting extra space.\r\n\r\nDucted heating keeps the entire home comfortable throughout the seasons, while an integrated security alarm provides added peace of mind. The fully fenced, easy-care garden offers usable outdoor space for children, a small pet or relaxed weekends without demanding hours of upkeep.\r\n\r\nA single internal-access garage and an additional off-street parking space complete the practical package. Backed by a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee, with the Title and CCC already issued, this beautifully finished home is ready to move in and enjoy.\r\n\r\nFeatures You’ll Love:\r\n\r\n•  Four bedrooms and two bathrooms, including a master ensuite, all on one easy level\r\n•  Light-filled open-plan living with wide stacking doors and an elevated outlook\r\n•  Contemporary kitchen with quality appliances, generous bench space and excellent storage\r\n•  Ducted heating throughout and an integrated security alarm\r\n•  Fully fenced, easy-care garden, single internal-access garage and additional off-street parking\r\n•  10-Year Master Build Guarantee, with Title and CCC issued, ready to move in and enjoy\r\n\r\nViewing Directions:\r\n\r\nEnter 251 West Hoe Heights, Orewa into your GPS. Turn left at the roundabout, enter the development when you see the Strathmill sign, then follow the directional signs to 6 Moko Road.\r\n\r\nSet within Orewa’s growing Strathmill community, the home offers easy access to schools, shops, cafés, Orewa Beach and motorway connections. The future Flavell Drive connection is expected to improve access towards State Highway 1, adding further convenience to this growing location.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your viewing.",
